OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry with some bright
OL,6,Fspells developing, the best of these
OL,7,Fthrough the afternoon. Cloudy around
OL,8,Fthe west coast outbreaks of rain over
OL,9,Fthe islands, nudging into Argyll at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe rain pushing east during
OL,13,Fthis evening, turning light and
OL,14,Fpatchy. Mainly dry with clear spells
OL,15,Fovernight, a touch of frost possible,
OL,16,Falthough a few showers around the west
OL,17,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
