OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,6,Fwith some sunny spells, although the
OL,7,Fodd showers possible. Light
OL,8,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FIt
OL,11,Fwill be mainly dry and settled as high
OL,12,Fpressure dominates. Chilly nights if
OL,13,Fskies remain clear with a frost
OL,14,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
